{"text":"There is nothing as embarrassing and uncomfortable as trying to make people laugh and hearing nothing but silence in response. When it was my turn to get up and do the exercise, I tried all sorts of buffoonery. I flat my arms like a bird, I rolled on the floor, I jumped up and down, and ah, I didn't believe I was particularly funny, and I was desperate to find something to hide behind. I was fresh out of ideas, and there had still not been a single laugh in the room. Eventually, my teacher called me out, Chris Bays. He said, you failed Lupita, haven't you? And at that point, I let it all go, and broke down and cried audibly. It was only then that everyone in the room burst out laughing. Because I had finally allowed myself to be honest and truthful and open with them. My inner fool came out to play only once I had put my ego aside.","words":[{"text":"There","start":0.0,"end":0.68},{"text":"is","start":0.68,"end":1.48},{"text":"nothing","start":1.48,"end":1.66},{"text":"as","start":1.66,"end":2.1},{"text":"embarrassing","start":2.1,"end":2.9},{"text":"and","start":2.9,"end":3.98},{"text":"uncomfortable","start":3.98,"end":4.94},{"text":"as","start":4.94,"end":5.66},{"text":"trying","start":5.66,"end":5.96},{"text":"to","start":5.96,"end":6.2},{"text":"make","start":6.2,"end":6.38},{"text":"people","start":6.38,"end":6.74},{"text":"laugh","start":6.74,"end":7.12},{"text":"and","start":7.12,"end":7.7},{"text":"hearing","start":7.7,"end":8.02},{"text":"nothing","start":8.02,"end":8.32},{"text":"but","start":8.32,"end":8.7},{"text":"silence","start":8.7,"end":9.12},{"text":"in","start":9.12,"end":9.4},{"text":"response","start":9.4,"end":9.84,"punct":"."},{"text":"When","start":10.8,"end":10.94},{"text":"it","start":10.94,"end":11.04},{"text":"was","start":11.04,"end":11.16},{"text":"my","start":11.16,"end":11.36},{"text":"turn","start":11.36,"end":11.54},{"text":"to","start":11.54,"end":11.74},{"text":"get","start":11.74,"end":11.86},{"text":"up","start":11.86,